{
  "inShort": "Behind at day 28: the playable-slice goal was missed. The devlog provides no checkable build or five-player findings, so completion remains unknown. Mia stopped confirming work after week 1, leaving only Alex's participation confirmed for co-op sailing and testing.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvkg08t8nxz8v55cyzd7",
      "text": "A public repository of the Godot demo projects the game builds on is done. The inspected repository supplies demos, an MIT license and import instructions. It does not show this game's playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvop08t9nxz8eq2wcl2h",
      "text": "An animated reference video for the art style remains done. The inspected title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny. The video was not watched, so its animated style could not be verified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvsb08tanxz8bbdrwz5d",
      "text": "A reference article on what playtesting is, for the team to read is done. The inspected article explains playtesting and its formats. It supplies guidance, not findings from five players."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvu308tbnxz8zjhu1ed9",
      "text": "A private design board for the team remains done. No inspected contents establish progress on the playable slice."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The published prototype devlog satisfies the sole required task for passing Prototyping. That does not establish the separate playable-slice goal.",
    "The landscape image shows mountains, not the tide loop. The linked film's title and thumbnail show Big Buck Bunny, not co-op sailing. Neither demonstrates progress toward the goal.",
    "No artifacts were added this sprint. The reported build and edited video have no checkable game evidence, and no launch instructions or five-player findings were supplied."
  ],
  "questions": []
}

